    <briefdescription>
<para>Per-query cost model that integrates with OptimizerCostModel. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Records actual query execution costs using <ref refid="classthemis_1_1performance_1_1_hardware_cycle_counter" kindref="compound">HardwareCycleCounter</ref> and derives calibration factors that can be applied to OptimizerCostModel constants so subsequent cost estimates are grounded in real hardware measurements.</para>
<para>Thread-safety: all public methods are safe to call concurrently. The internal record store is protected by a mutex; the RAII timer helper is single-threaded per query.</para>
<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1performance_1_1phase3_1_1_per_query_cost_model_1a0635cad475ea83bbbcd893fffd85040c" kindref="member">PerQueryCostModel</ref><sp/>pcm;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">OptimizerCostModel<sp/>model;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Wrap<sp/>a<sp/>query<sp/>execution:</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>guard<sp/>=<sp/>pcm.beginQuery(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;index_scan&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>42.0);<sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>estimated</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>...<sp/>execute<sp/>query<sp/>...</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>guard.end(rows_returned,<sp/>pages_read);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Periodically<sp/>calibrate:</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">pcm.calibrate(model);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
